          "channel": "STREET_EVENT",
          "conditions": [],
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "choice_1",
              "text": "讓傭兵們等等，我們先釐清事實!",
              "resultText": "",
              "effects": []
            },
            {
              "id": "choice_2",
              "text": "繼續探索，如有龍就討伐，資源比起一切更重要!",
              "resultText": "",
              "effects": [
                {
                  "type": "CREATE_SUBJUGATION_NODE",
                  "definition": {
                    "nodeId": "dragon_fam_dun_2",
                    "name": "充滿龍晶的洞穴深處",
                    "description": "描述此據點的敵方勢力與地理環境...",
                    "placement": "NEAR_PLAYER",
                    "radius": 8,
                    "terrain": "RUINS",
                    "difficulty": 10,
                    "enemyFeature": "BALANCED",
                    "requiresScouting": false,
                    "removeOnVictory": true,
                    "journeyNodeIds": [],
                    "templateId": "dragon_fam_dun_2",
                    "victoryNodeId": "dragon_fam_3w_02w",
                    "defeatNodeId": "dragon_fam_3w_02l",
                    "defeatDelayDays": 0
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "completionEffects": [],
          "dialoguePages": [
            {
              "speakerType": "PLAYER_GUARDIAN",
              "speakerName": "神秘女性",
              "speakerTitle": "",
              "speakerAvatar": "npc_common:npc_dragon_f",
              "text": "「大人正為領地的財政籌謀，若無重要政務匯報，請立刻退下！」"
            },
            {
              "speakerType": "NPC",
              "speakerName": "神秘女性",
              "speakerTitle": "",
              "speakerAvatar": "npc_common:npc_dragon_f",
              "text": "「你們正在玩火！請召回你們剛派出的傭兵，不要再靠近那個洞窟了……」"
            },
            {
              "speakerType": "PLAYER_GUARDIAN",
              "speakerName": "神秘女性",
              "speakerTitle": "【街角遇見的旅人】",
              "speakerAvatar": "npc_common:npc_dragon_f",
              "text": "「召回？大人手下的傭兵團剛帶回第一批純金幣。神秘的女士，憑你一句話，就想讓大人放棄一座能充實領地金庫的寶庫？」"
            },
            {
              "speakerType": "NPC",
              "speakerName": "神秘女性",
              "speakerTitle": "",
              "speakerAvatar": "npc_common:npc_dragon_f",
              "text": "「那不是寶庫，那是安息所！那些金幣不是賞賜，是我們向周圍獵戶交換藥品與生活用品的代價……酒鬼偷走的是最後一筆生活費。」"
            },
            {
              "speakerType": "PLAYER_GUARDIAN",
              "speakerName": "神秘女性",
              "speakerTitle": "【街角遇見的旅人】",
              "speakerAvatar": "npc_common:npc_dragon_f",
              "text": "「大人，她的眼睛……帶有傳說中龍化的特質，這傢伙不是普通人。」"
            },
            {
              "speakerType": "NPC",
              "speakerName": "神秘女性",
              "speakerTitle": "",
              "speakerAvatar": "npc_common:npc_dragon_f",
              "text": "「洞窟裡沒有惡龍，只有一頭連翅膀都無法張開、活了上千年的瀕死老龍。我們這些罹患『龍化病』的人被世人視為異類，只有它收留我們。如果傭兵發動攻擊，它臨死前的反撲會夷平半個城鎮——請召回他們，我們願意提供龍鱗與古老技術作為賠償。」"
            },
            {
              "speakerType": "PLAYER_GUARDIAN",
              "speakerName": "神秘女性",
              "speakerTitle": "【街角遇見的旅人】",
              "speakerAvatar": "npc_common:npc_dragon_f",
              "text": "領主大人，等你指令，我們該如何處置?"
            }
          ],
          "npcAvatar": "npc_common:npc_dragon_f",
          "npcName": "神秘女性"
        },
